  "limits": [
    "Cross-owner gestures are sequential and non-atomic; Slice and Drill select one owner per placement.",
    "Radius 0–24; maximum 4,096-cell native transaction, 65,536 footprint probes and 2,048 sweep steps; one outstanding edit. Continued strokes use an approximately 30/s service throttle; fresh presses and Slice commits may request immediate service.",
    "Live Drill release before safe admission cancels the placement. Hold until admitted, or pause for a precise click.",
    "Slice release commits one immutable bounded line with a two-second safe-admission deadline. Camera, tool, pause and scene cancellation stop unadmitted work; admitted work is not rolled back.",
    "Scene replacement retires the old owner and receipt generation; a retired old-owner action is not promised a new-scene publication.",
    "Capacity refusals preserve inventory; unexpected post-write failures report the accounted prefix or uncertain completion and hold. No general rollback guarantee.",
    "Save start reconstructs authored material and acknowledged ordinary terrain cuts; no live body pose, damage or combustion checkpoint.",
    "The inactive-edit tower medians are 4.60% and 6.45% lower in short matched windows; causal attribution and physical-owner performance remain unresolved.",
    "Impact, repair, detached-body addition, welding, stress/fatigue and M5 scheduling are deferred.",
    "Mainline reconciliation is pending; PR #754 remains Draft/HOLD.",
    "A complete fresh hosted action took 1,274.907 ms from admission to Main publication; 1,259.730 ms was after its native receipt. The stage concentration is observed; its cause and physical-owner impact are not isolated."
  ],
